      "content": "I'm not a doctor, but I can provide some general guidance. It's generally not recommended to take Advil (ibuprofen) if you're already taking Xarelto (rivaroxaban) for your heart condition. Since Xarelto is a blood thinner, taking ibuprofen may increase the risk of bleeding, even if it's just a normal dose. I recommend consulting your doctor or pharmacist to discuss the potential interactions and alternative pain management options.",
